;; chopi's seatbelt network profile. Disallows any incoming connections and
;; only allows outgoing traffic through the smokescreen proxy. chopi appends
;; this (with safehouse's --append-profile) on every run, so it lands LAST in
;; the composed policy and its (deny network*) overrides whatever network
;; access safehouse's own profile leaves open.

(deny network*)
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:4760"))
